Keep JUCE popup menus override-redirect under Wine 10+/11.

JUCE creates popup menus, drop shadows, and tooltips with WS_POPUP | WS_SYSMENU.
Wine 10+ treats WS_POPUP windows with WS_SYSMENU as WM-managed top-level windows
(winex11.drv is_window_managed), causing xwayland-satellite / niri focus changes
to dismiss them immediately. Strip WS_SYSMENU from captionless, non-resizable
popup windows via a thread-scoped WH_CBT hook while an editor is open
(disable with YABRIDGE_NO_POPUP_FIX=1).

Upstream reference:
- https://github.com/robbert-vdh/yabridge/pull/544
- https://github.com/robbert-vdh/yabridge/issues/521

